    "hc.cli.help": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]. This adapter uses c11's existing core; start, stop and update are managed by c11."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]. このアダプターは c11 の既存のコアを使用します。起動、停止、アップデートは c11 が管理します。"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]. Цей адаптер використовує наявне ядро c11; запуск, зупинка й оновлення керуються c11."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]. 이 어댑터는 c11의 기존 코어를 사용하며, 시작, 중지, 업데이트는 c11이 관리합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]. 此适配器使用 c11 现有的核心；启动、停止和更新均由 c11 管理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]。此轉接器使用 c11 現有的核心；start、stop 和 update 由 c11 管理。"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: c11 hc server status|restart; c11 hc ls; c11 hc machine ls; c11 hc get <terminal>; c11 hc run [--cwd <path>] [--env K=V] [--label K=V] -- <program> [args]. Этот адаптер использует существующее ядро c11; запуском, остановкой и обновлением управляет c11."
          }
        }
      }
    },
